<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 437)</h2>
<p><b>The review session, flattened into a QuickTime.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Export Movie can now <b>hold the picture while voice notes play</b>: at each note's frame the movie freezes, the note's audio plays — speaker chip, progress line, transcript below — then playback resumes. Marks, voice, and words in one file that plays anywhere. Tick it in the export dialog.</li>
<li>Several notes on a frame queue in the order they were made; the clip's own sound pauses during a hold and resumes exactly where it left off.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
